        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions PR-PCF01060, 60 Inch Overall Length Back-to-Back Pair of Pacific Acrylic Pulls</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Pacific Acrylic Door Pull Back-to-Back Pair is available in both clear or frosted acrylic finishes. This door handle comes packaged as a back-to-back pair--pulls attach to each other through the door--including a pair of lock-down rosettes (not pictured). It is 60 inches overall in length with a 24 inch center to center. The Pacific Acrylic Door Handle has a 1 inch diameter regardless of the length. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with Back to Back mounting (2 door pulls bolted to each other - 1 door pull for each side of a door). Includes lock down threaded rosettes to securely tighten the door pulls to the door. Also available: Individual <a href=\"/products/pacific-acrylic-door-pull-first-impressions-pcf100sbr\"><b>First Impressions Model PCF01</b></a> for one side of a door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions PR-PCF01 Acrylic Door Pull Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Clear or Frosted Acrylic</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 60\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—  it can be custom designed to fit your specific door application in lengths up to 6 feet. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back to Back mounting.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "60 Inch Pacific Acrylic Door Pull Back-to-Back Pair,",
                "description": "The Pacific Acrylic Door Pull Back-to-Back Pair is available in both clear or frosted acrylic finishes. This door handle comes packaged as a back-to-back pair--pulls attach to each other through the door--including a pair of lock-down rosettes (not pictured). It is 60 inches overall in length. The Pacific Acrylic Door Handle has a 1 inch diameter regardless of the length.",
